<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest level Sept 13.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest level Sept 13.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool on Friday detailed the level of harvest progress as of Sept 13.</p>
<p>CROP		     COMBINED (PCT)  COMBINED SEPT 13/95</p>
<p>Hard Red Spring Wheat 23		  34</p>
<p>Canada Prairie Spring 13		  26</p>
<p>Soft White Spring     76		  42</p>
<p>Winter Wheat	   100		  97</p>
<p>Durum Wheat	     69		  34</p>
<p>Oats			16		  24</p>
<p>Barley		    32		  40</p>
<p>Flax			 7		  22</p>
<p>Fall Rye		  77		  88</p>
<p>Canola		    29		  39</p>
<p>Total:		    28		  37</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
